          "slice": "CrossCellSearchAttempted",
          "description": "1b.3: all submissions from a given broker across all cells they're authorized for, with status breakdown - a cross-cell view ops needs for reconciliation even though individual underwriters don't for day-to-day work. Confirms Search & Retrieval needs at least two permission tiers baked in from day one (cell-scoped vs cross-cell), not a generic search with permission filtering bolted on afterward.",
